"The four box channels and the per-class scores are pulled out directly::"
msgstr "สี่ช่องกรอบและคะแนนต่อคลาสถูกดึงออกมาโดยตรง::"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/ml/postprocessing/yolov8-walkthrough.rst:115
msgid ""
"``bb_scores`` is the best class score per surviving anchor; ``bb_classes`` "
